%% Sprint Bankroll-3 — RF-6 Stop-loss / Stop-win state machine (ADR-060)
%% Estados do stop_lock_until em user_settings.
%% USD consolidado (D3). Reset 00:00 user TZ. Stop-win nao bloqueia (banner only).

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: PUT /user-settings/stops<br/>stopLossUsd=300, stopWinUsd=800<br/>stop_lock_until=NULL

    Idle --> Tracking: POST /api/grind-sessions ok<br/>(assertNotStopLocked passa)

    Tracking --> NearLimit: PUT /grind-sessions/:id status=completed<br/>evaluateStops calcula deltaUsd diario<br/>|delta| > 0.7 * stopLossUsd<br/>(banner amarelo)

    NearLimit --> Tracking: nova sessao start<br/>delta dentro do limite

    Tracking --> Locked: evaluateStops detecta<br/>deltaUsd <= -stopLossUsd<br/>UPDATE stop_lock_until = NOW + 12h<br/>telemetry stop_loss_triggered

    NearLimit --> Locked: evaluateStops detecta<br/>deltaUsd <= -stopLossUsd

    Tracking --> WinReached: evaluateStops detecta<br/>deltaUsd >= stopWinUsd<br/>telemetry stop_win_reached<br/>SEM lock (D3)

    NearLimit --> WinReached: evaluateStops detecta<br/>deltaUsd >= stopWinUsd

    WinReached --> Tracking: jogador continua<br/>(banner amber sugere encerrar)<br/>nova sessao OK

    WinReached --> Idle: 00:00 user TZ<br/>delta resetado naturalmente

    Locked --> SessionBlocked: POST /api/grind-sessions<br/>assertNotStopLocked throw<br/>423 Locked<br/>telemetry stop_locked_session_blocked

    SessionBlocked --> Locked: cliente exibe banner<br/>countdown ate stop_lock_until

    Locked --> Idle: stop_lock_until <= NOW<br/>(passagem natural do tempo)<br/>OU 00:00 user TZ<br/>(novo dia, delta reseta)

    Locked --> Idle: POST /user-settings/stops/release<br/>(admin/debug, flag opcional)<br/>UPDATE stop_lock_until=NULL<br/>telemetry stop_lock_released_manual

    note right of Idle
        bankrollManagementEnabled=false
        → todos os states no-op
        → assertNotStopLocked retorna ok direto
        → evaluateStops retorna stopReached=null
    end note

    note right of Locked
        Lock dura stop_lock_duration_hours
        (default 12, range 1-72).
        Mudanca de duration mid-day
        NAO retroage no lock atual.
    end note

    note left of Tracking
        deltaUsd consolidado em USD
        via fxResolver (ADR-061).
        Apenas sessions completed contam.
    end note
